{{wikipedia}}
[[File:Gray1095 parts.png|thumb|right|Gall bladder with ducts.]]

===Alternative forms===
* [[gallbladder]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[gall]] [[bladder]]}}

# {{anatomy}} A pear-shaped organ that stores [[bile]] from the [[liver]], until the body needs it for the digestion and absorption of fats in the [[duodenum]].

====Synonyms====
* [[cholecyst]]
* [[vescica biliaris]]
* [[vescica fellea]]

